# Arke provenance traces are written here at runtime:
#   {condition_id[:16]}.json — the inputs + outputs that produced a call,
#   sha256-hashed and stored in the DB as reasoning_cid (sha256:<hex>).
# Generated JSON is gitignored; this file just keeps the directory tracked.
# Roadmap: pin these to IPFS; the sha256 stays the verifiable content hash.
